@startuml

actor User
participant "Individuals API" as Individuals
participant "Person Service" as PersonService
participant Keycloak
participant "Webhook Collector Service" as WebhookCollector
participant Kafka
participant "Notification Service\nKafka Consumer" as NotificationConsumer
participant "Notification Service" as NotificationService
database "Notification DB\nPostgreSQL" as NotificationDb
participant "Email Service" as EmailService
participant "SMTP Server" as SMTP

== Регистрация пользователя ==

User -> Individuals: POST /registration

Individuals -> PersonService: Создать пользователя
PersonService --> Individuals: userUid

Individuals -> Keycloak: Создать пользователя

alt Регистрация успешна
    Keycloak --> Individuals: Пользователь создан

    Individuals -> Kafka: notification.created\nUSER_REGISTERED
    Kafka --> Individuals: Event accepted

    Individuals --> User: 200 OK + token
else Ошибка создания в Keycloak
    Keycloak --> Individuals: Error
    Individuals -> PersonService: Компенсация - удалить пользователя
    Individuals --> User: Registration failed
end


== Уведомление от Webhook Collector ==

WebhookCollector -> Kafka: notification.created
Kafka --> WebhookCollector: Event accepted


== Обработка notification.created ==

Kafka -> NotificationConsumer: NotificationCreated (Avro)

NotificationConsumer -> NotificationService: process(notification)

NotificationService -> NotificationDb: Сохранить уведомление\nstatus = NEW
NotificationDb --> NotificationService: Notification saved

alt type == USER_REGISTERED
    NotificationService -> EmailService: Отправить welcome email
    EmailService -> SMTP: SEND email
    SMTP --> EmailService: Accepted
    EmailService --> NotificationService: Email sent
end

NotificationService --> NotificationConsumer: Processing completed


== Получение уведомлений ==

User -> NotificationService: GET /api/v1/notifications/{userUid}
NotificationService -> NotificationDb: SELECT by userUid
NotificationDb --> NotificationService: Notifications
NotificationService --> User: 200 OK + notifications


== Изменение статуса ==

User -> NotificationService: PATCH /api/v1/notifications/{id}/status
NotificationService -> NotificationDb: NEW -> COMPLETED
NotificationDb --> NotificationService: Updated notification
NotificationService --> User: 200 OK

@enduml